      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784536206519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "N(A) is all vectors x such that Ax = 0. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "N(A) is all vectors x such that Ax = 0. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4iRdvrCYssmLcNMxG7ljg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 275.4991488692201,
      "y": 339.392333984375,
      "width": 725.8190307617188,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1782021599,
      "version": 592,
      "versionNonce": 1592827853,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784536206519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It's used to find all solutions of a system which has at least one free variable.\n\nWe know if we have m equations and n variables where m < n, then there will\nbe free variables so that some of them related to others. Think of 1 equations \nand have 2 unknowns.\n\nFor Ax = b, we can find out all solutions by adding 1 particular solution and N(A)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It's used to find all solutions of a system which has at least one free variable.\n\nWe know if we have m equations and n variables where m < n, then there will\nbe free variables so that some of them related to others. Think of 1 equations \nand have 2 unknowns.\n\nFor Ax = b, we can find out all solutions by adding 1 particular solution and N(A)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
