    {
      "id": "5NNOeiPCVSUbWsel--T5E",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 272.177927873603,
      "y": 2450.6184550537537,
      "width": 875.1387939453125,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 576001467,
      "version": 498,
      "versionNonce": 614551541,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784806019008,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In general for higher dimensions, the complete solution is x_p + (linear combination in null space)\nFor example, suppose it's 5 dimensions with 2 pivots and 3 free variables\n\nx_p = (7,0,0,2,0) \n\n3 special solutions in null space = (-3,1,0,0,0), (-5,0,1,0,0) and (-7,0,0,-2,1)\n\nx_complete = (7,0,0,2,0) + x2·(-3,1,0,0,0) + x3·(-5,0,1,0,0) + x5·(-7,0,0,-2,1)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In general for higher dimensions, the complete solution is x_p + (linear combination in null space)\nFor example, suppose it's 5 dimensions with 2 pivots and 3 free variables\n\nx_p = (7,0,0,2,0) \n\n3 special solutions in null space = (-3,1,0,0,0), (-5,0,1,0,0) and (-7,0,0,-2,1)\n\nx_complete = (7,0,0,2,0) + x2·(-3,1,0,0,0) + x3·(-5,0,1,0,0) + x5·(-7,0,0,-2,1)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
